@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 13. MCP State Machine (Synced with Source, 2026-05-14)

skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> REQUEST_VALIDATED
REQUEST_VALIDATED --> SCOPE_RESOLVED
SCOPE_RESOLVED --> HISTORY_LOADED
HISTORY_LOADED --> PLANNED

PLANNED --> EXECUTING : planRequired=true
PLANNED --> COMPOSING : planRequired=false

EXECUTING --> TOOL_SCHEMA_REFRESHED : reconnect-first
TOOL_SCHEMA_REFRESHED --> COMPOSING : execute loop finished

COMPOSING --> COMPLETED
COMPOSING --> A2A_TASK_COMPLETED : if a2aCtx exists && success
COMPOSING --> A2A_TASK_FAILED : if a2aCtx exists && error
A2A_TASK_COMPLETED --> COMPLETED
A2A_TASK_FAILED --> COMPLETED

COMPLETED --> [*]
HUMAN_MESSAGE --> [*]
ERROR --> HUMAN_MESSAGE

note right of EXECUTING
Tool loop is bounded
- execute plan
- append trace
- re-plan
- max iterations guard (4)
end note

note right of SCOPE_RESOLVED
HttpChatController: unrestricted scope
Product/Reservation/Search: restricted scope
A2A Product/Reservation/Search: same restricted scope
end note

note left
A2A_TASK_RUNNING is marked before orchestrator execute
at BaseA2AControllerSupport(createAndMarkRunning).
end note

@enduml
